 "summary_en": "The clearest activity is lung cancer screening. OYS and the Finnish Cancer Registry have a low-dose CT screening pilot starting in January, with stop-smoking support for every participant. It follows an earlier FICAN North pilot that began in autumn 2022. OYS also publishes a lung cancer care pathway: the university hospital runs the multidisciplinary meetings and does the surgery and radiotherapy, including stereotactic radiotherapy. I found no regional decisions, waiting-time figures, nurse navigators, or plans for EBUS or molecular testing capacity.",
 "not_found_en": "I found no regional board decisions, investments or published waiting-time figures for lung cancer care. The OYS pathway page on referrals returned a \"page not found\" error, so I could not check its referral rules.",
